SUMMARY:Play in Clay: Tinkling Mushroom Bells - 1 Day Event! $45\, paid in
  advance
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**🌟 Full Circle Studio 
 Presents: Play in Clay - Tinkling Mushroom Bells 🌟**\nGet ready to unle
 ash your creativity in this **magical clay adventure**!\n\n**🗓 Dates & 
 Details:**\n\n* **Sat\, Oct 31\, 2026\, 10AM**: Make and glaze your projec
 t.\n* **Cost**: $45\nIncludes all materials (clay\, use of tools\, glaze a
 nd kiln firing)!\n\n🎉 **Event Highlights:**\nIn this one-day event\, yo
 u’ll Make & Glaze your project.\nThe stem is separate from the mushroom 
 cap so it sets on the stem. When you put it in the garden\, it moves & tin
 kles in the wind.\n\nThis is a great opportunity to explore your creativit
 y\, meet fellow art lovers\, and take home a unique handmade piece! No pri
 or experience needed.\n\n✨ **Saturday\, October 31\, 2026 - Make & Glaze
 **\n\n**🎨 Perfect For:**\n\n* Beginners curious about clay (16+)\n* Exp
 erienced creators looking to add a touch of magic to their skills\n\nNo ex
 perience? No problem! We’ll provide everything you need\, including mate
 rials and kiln firing.\n\n💌 **Bring:** Just your passion and a playful 
 spirit. We’ll handle the rest!\nDon’t miss this enchanting opportunity
  to create something truly special. Spaces are limited—reserve your spot
  today!
