SUMMARY:Women’s Art & Craft Gathering
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**Women's Creative Craft N
 ites**\n[PLS REGISTER/PAY HERE!](https://www.taradickinson.com/classes/art
 -classes)\n*\\*Please register on Tara's website: link above. -Thank you*\
 n\nThis open studio is for us to foster community\, connection\, & creativ
 ity- a place for your nervous system to feel safe 💜\n\nSeveral differen
 t relaxing art projects to choose from:\n💥Collage\n💥Art journal\n
 💥Zen Doodles\n💥Make a Book or a Box\n💥 Holiday-themed note cards\
 n\n**Or bring your own project & hang out! It's about connection & creatio
 n in a safe space.**\n\n*FEE: $10*\nAll art supplies provided.\nBYOB drink
 s & snacks (wine welcome)\, kitchen on site.\n\\*Note: This is a recurring
  event every Wednesday.
