SUMMARY:Seasonal Wreaths: Beginner Watercolor Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n\\*\\*Please REGISTER ON T
 ARA'S WEBSITE to attend this workshop.\n**Link HERE:** https://www.taradic
 kinson.com/classes/art-classes\nThank you!\n\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Let the colors 
 of autumn inspire you!**\nHave you always wanted to try watercolor paintin
 g but weren't sure where to begin?\n\nOr maybe you'd love an afternoon to 
 slow down\, get creative\, & make something beautiful.\n\nJoin me for a **
 Seasonal Wreaths: Beginner Watercolor Workshop**!\n\nWe'll explore the mag
 ic of watercolor & learn foundational techniques for painting leaves\, flo
 rals\, & beautiful layers of autumn color.\n\nYou'll discover how to use d
 ifferent brushstrokes\, build depth\, & add details that bring your painti
 ng to life.\n\\*No experience necessary\n\\* All supplies provided\n\\* Pa
 int your own seasonal wreath\, plus notecards to share or keep!\n\nBring y
 our curiosity & enjoy a relaxed\, creative afternoon.\nYou'll leave with n
 ew skills\, beautiful artwork\, and inspiration to keep painting!\n\n🧡 
 Give yourself those moments to create something lovely!
