SUMMARY:Wise Woman Sanctuary\, safe place for women to create through Expr
 essive Painting
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**Wise Woman Sanctuary\, A
  Safe Place for Women to Explorate Through Image**\n\nStep into a transfor
 mative space where for women to delve into **self-exploration\, art therap
 y**\, and mindfulness come together to nurture your inner wisdom. At **Wis
 e Women Sanctuary**\, we invite you to engage in **Personal Exploration Th
 rough Image**\, using creativity as a pathway to connect with your inner s
 elf.\n\nThis **Creative Expression Workshop** blends **painting\, meditati
 on**\, and holistic wellness practices to deepen your **self-awareness** a
 nd inspire **self-empowerment**. Guided by Christi Corradi\, a seasoned me
 ntor in **manifestation** and the **Universal Principles**\, you’ll unco
 ver new tools for personal growth and gain profound insights into your jou
 rney.\nThrough the magic of **mixed media art**\, you’ll explore how ima
 gery can reveal answers within\, sparking creativity and fostering a deepe
 r understanding of your unique path.\n\n**Details:**\n✨ **Location**: Wi
 se Women Sanctuary\n✨ **Schedule**: Groups meet on the 4th Monday of the
  month\n✨ **Duration**: 3 hours\n✨ **Cost**: First session free\, but 
 you will pay to reserve your space and receive a refund.\n\nWhether you’
 re a beginner or an experienced artist\, this workshop invites you to let 
 your imagination soar and create meaningful art that resonates with your p
 ersonal journey. Connect\, create\, and discover the transformative power 
 of image and creativity at Wise Women Sanctuary.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/full-circle-studio/events/317185502/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261029T024349Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029T024349Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
